"""
watchsports - Modern, beautiful CLI Live Sports & Channel Streamer.
Searches live fixtures, real-time match statuses, verified live sports networks (La Liga, Premier League, UCL, F1, NBA),
and streams instantly in mpv or Streamlink with automatic link health verification.
"""

